ternal text\" href=\"https://ko.wikisource.org/wiki/개역한글판/디도서#1장\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">디도서 1:7</a>. <q>더러운 이를 탐하지 아니하며</q></cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%EB%94%94%EB%8F%84%EC%84%9C+1%3A7&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fko.wikisource.org%2Fwiki%2F%EA%B0%9C%EC%97%AD%ED%95%9C%EA%B8%80%ED%8C%90%2F%EB%94%94%EB%8F%84%EC%84%9C%231%EC%9E%A5&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fchurchofgod.wiki%3A%EA%B0%90%EB%8F%85\"><span style=\"display:none;\"> </span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-33\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-33\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite class=\"citation web\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ko.wikisource.org/wiki/개역한글판/디도서#1장\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">디도서 1:9</a>. <q>선을 좋아하며</q></cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%EB%94%94%EB%8F%84%EC%84%9C+1%3A9&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fko.wikisource.org%2Fwiki%2F%EA%B0%9C%EC%97%AD%ED%95%9C%EA%B8%80%ED%8C%90%2F%EB%94%94%EB%8F%84%EC%84%9C%231%EC%9E%A5&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fchurchofgod.wiki%3A%EA%B0%90%EB%8F%85\"><span style=\"display:none;\"> </span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-34\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-34\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite class=\"citation web\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ko.wikisource.org/wiki/개역한글판/디도서#1장\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">디도서 1:8</a>. <q>의로우며 거룩하며</q></cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%EB%94%94%EB%8F%84%EC%84%9C+1%3A8&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fko.wikisource.org%2Fwiki%2F%EA%B0%9C%EC%97%AD%ED%95%9C%EA%B8%80%ED%8C%90%2F%EB%94%94%EB%8F%84%EC%84%9C%231%EC%